# The DuckDB engine this client builds against: the commit, then the version
# name core's nightly built that commit under. Both come from the same "Main"
# run of duckdb/duckdb on the engine branch: the version is v<release>-alpha<run
# number>, and it is not derivable from the commit. The engine looks up
# extensions under that name (extensions.duckdb.org/<version>/<platform>/), so
# a bundle built without it names itself v2.0.0-dev<count> and can INSTALL
# nothing. CI rebuilds the bundle when either line changes.
